* Symptom 1 (Figure 1)
* Symptom 2

== Solution ==
<!-- 
PP1V8_AWAKE shorted to ground due to liquid damage around C4522 and C4526. Replaced these and others corroded components in this area. C4526 is a 9.1uF pass through cap so can sourced off a donor 820-1700 board or Digikey/Mouser (Murata NFM15PC915D0E3)

-->



